#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# frame_ticks

#% text
# `frame_ticks` is an option of graphics and plots: `automatic`, `none`, or `[[left, right], [bottom, top]]` giving the ticks of each side of the frame.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# Each side takes the same values as `ticks`. A tick `[position, label, length]` with length below 1 is a minor mark.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
plot(sin(x), [x, 0, 2pi], frame_ticks: [[automatic, none], [[0, pi, 2pi], none]])
#% output
